{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2661730/extras/s2.png?t=1745621290\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Make It Your Own Journey</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Apu's Journey</strong> is a retro action-RPG inspired by the golden era of adventure games!<br>Conquer challenging dungeons, defeat mysterious creatures, collect secret items, and unlock new abilities to forge your own path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get ready for a journey full of discovery and nostalgia, set in a world styled after the classic Game Boy era!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2661730/extras/LINE.png?t=1745621290\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2661730/extras/s6.png?t=1745621290\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A blend of puzzles, action, and exploration in a top-down style inspired by classics like <i>The Legend of Zelda</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Monochromatic pixel art with selectable color palettes to recreate the old-school handheld atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Achievement system: unlock dozens of hidden feats as you explore every corner of the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adjustable difficulty modes: play casually or push your limits with intense challenges!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Full controller support: experience the retro feeling in the most authentic way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2661730/extras/LINE.png?t=1745621290\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2661730/extras/s1.png?t=1745621290\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">An Ancient Creature Awaits...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you help Apu defeat <strong>The One Who Wears Shadows</strong> and destroy the three sealed masks?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you're ready, prepare yourself for a journey that echoes the nostalgia of the classics!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2661730?t=1745621290","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2661730/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745621290","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2661730/ee8c9a50d2f41cbbd5f59874bbf2c923fb302435/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745621290","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2661730/ee8c9a50d2f41cbbd5f59874bbf2c923fb302435/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745621290","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2661730/extras/s2.png?t=1745621290\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Make It Your Own Journey</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Apu's Journey</strong> is a retro action-RPG inspired by the golden era of adventure games!<br>Conquer challenging dungeons, defeat mysterious creatures, collect secret items, and unlock new abilities to forge your own path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get ready for a journey full of discovery and nostalgia, set in a world styled after the classic Game Boy era!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2661730/extras/LINE.png?t=1745621290\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2661730/extras/s6.png?t=1745621290\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A blend of puzzles, action, and exploration in a top-down style inspired by classics like <i>The Legend of Zelda</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Monochromatic pixel art with selectable color palettes to recreate the old-school handheld atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Achievement system: unlock dozens of hidden feats as you explore every corner of the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adjustable difficulty modes: play casually or push your limits with intense challenges!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Full controller support: experience the retro feeling in the most authentic way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2661730/extras/LINE.png?t=1745621290\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2661730/extras/s1.png?t=1745621290\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">An Ancient Creature Awaits...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you help Apu defeat <strong>The One Who Wears Shadows</strong> and destroy the three sealed masks?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you're ready, prepare yourself for a journey that echoes the nostalgia of the classics!</p>","developers":["Cristiano Marques Rosa"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2661730/4e371041b79b03181a609327b144830e0149845f/header.jpg?t=174